 "instruction_head": "# Per-Service Rate Limiting and Connection Retry\n\nAdd per-service rate limiting using a token bucket algorithm and automatic connection retry with exponential backoff to the mesh router.\n\n## Rate Limiting\n\nEach service gets a configurable token bucket rate limiter applied before endpoint selection. New config fields on each `[[service]]`:\n\n- `rate_limit_rps` (int) \u2014 tokens per second; 0 means unlimited (default)\n- `rate_limit_burst` (int) \u2014 max bucket size; defaults to `rate_limit_rps` if omitte"
}